<section class=\"why\" id=\"why\" aria-labelledby=\"why-title\"><svg class=\"contours\" viewBox=\"0 0 600 800\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><ellipse cx=\"300\" cy=\"400\" rx=\"220\" ry=\"320\"/><ellipse cx=\"300\" cy=\"400\" rx=\"200\" ry=\"300\"/><ellipse cx=\"300\" cy=\"400\" rx=\"180\" ry=\"280\"/><ellipse cx=\"300\" cy=\"400\" rx=\"160\" ry=\"260\"/><ellipse cx=\"300\" cy=\"400\" rx=\"140\" ry=\"240\"/><ellipse cx=\"300\" cy=\"400\" rx=\"120\" ry=\"220\"/><ellipse cx=\"300\" cy=\"400\" rx=\"100\" ry=\"200\"/></svg><div class=\"container why-grid\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">Small is a good thing</p><h2 id=\"why-title\">For the gyms<br>with a little<br><em>more soul.</em></h2><p class=\"why-intro\">The ones where the owner sets routes, the staff know your name, and everyone cheers for your first send.</p></div><div class=\"principles\"><div class=\"principle\"><span class=\"principle-number\">01 /</span><div><h3>Only what you actually need.</h3><p>Memberships, bookings, and day passes. The everyday essentials, without a maze of menus.</p></div></div><div class=\"principle\"><span class=\"principle-number\">02 /</span><div><h3>A front desk that feels human.</h3><p>Keep your attention on the person in front of you. Give your team a clear view of who's climbing and what's next.</p></div></div><div class=\"principle\"><span class=\"principle-number\">03 /</span><div><h3>Your gym. Your way of doing things.</h3><p>Room for your memberships, your class schedule, and the community that makes your gym yours.</p></div></div></div></div></section>
