<section class="product" id="product" aria-labelledby="product-title"><div class="container"><div class="section-top"><div><p class="eyebrow">Everything in its place</p><h2 class="section-heading" id="product-title">Your whole gym.<br>One happy little home.</h2></div><p>From the first “can I try a climb?” to your everyday regulars. Keep the moving parts together, and the good days coming.</p></div><div class="feature-grid">
<article class="feature"><div class="feature-visual"><div class="mini-card"><div class="member-head"><div class="initials">MR</div><div><b>Maya Rivera</b><small>Part of the crew since March</small></div><span class="status">Active</span></div><div class="mini-line"><span>Monthly membership</span><strong>$65 / month</strong></div><p class="renewal"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-repeat"/></svg>Next renewal: November 1</p></div></div><div class="feature-label"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-members"/></svg><h3>Regulars, taken care of.</h3></div><p>Flexible memberships, automatic renewals, and member details in one place. Less chasing payments. More knowing names.</p><button class="text-link feature-link" data-open-demo="members">Meet your members <svg class="icon"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></button></article>
<article class="feature"><div class="feature-visual"><div class="mini-card"><div class="calendar-title">A good week ahead <span>October</span></div><div class="week"><div><small>MON</small>19</div><div><small>TUE</small>20</div><div class="selected"><small>WED</small>21</div><div><small>THU</small>22</div><div><small>FRI</small>23</div><div><small>SAT</small>24</div><div><small>SUN</small>25</div></div><div class="mini-booking"><div>Intro to bouldering<small>10:00 AM · 6 of 8 spots booked</small></div><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-check"/></svg></div></div></div><div class="feature-label"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-calendar"/></svg><h3>Full classes. Clear heads.</h3></div><p>Let climbers book their next session. Manage spots, instructors, and your schedule without the back-and-forth.</p><button class="text-link feature-link" data-open-demo="classes">Check out class bookings <svg class="icon"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></button></article>
<article class="feature"><div class="feature-visual"><div class="mini-card ticket"><div class="ticket-top"><span class="brand"><svg class="brand-mark" viewBox="0 0 40 34" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12c6-13 11 13 17 0S31 25 37 12M3 23c6-13 11 13 17 0s11 13 17 0"/></svg>tidepool</span><span>LET'"'S CLIMB</span></div><div class=\"ticket-title\"><b>One day. All the climbs.</b><span>"'$22</span></div><div class="ticket-bottom"><div class="barcode" aria-hidden="true"></div><span>You'"'re good to go.</span></div></div></div><div class=\"feature-label\"><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-ticket\"/></svg><h3>Drop in. Get climbing.</h3></div><p>Day passes that make walk-ins feel welcome. A quick check-in, a friendly hello, and they're on the wall.</p><button class=\"text-link feature-link\" data-open-demo=\"passes\">Try a day pass <svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-arrow\"/></svg></button></article>
