<section class=\"why\" id=\"why\" aria-labelledby=\"why-title\"><svg class=\"contours\" viewBox=\"0 0 600 800\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><ellipse cx=\"300\" cy=\"400\" rx=\"220\" ry=\"320\"/><ellipse cx=\"300\" cy=\"400\" rx=\"200\" ry=\"300\"/><ellipse cx=\"300\" cy=\"400\" rx=\"180\" ry=\"280\"/><ellipse cx=\"300\" cy=\"400\" rx=\"160\" ry=\"260\"/><ellipse cx=\"300\" cy=\"400\" rx=\"140\" ry=\"240\"/><ellipse cx=\"300\" cy=\"400\" rx=\"120\" ry=\"220\"/><ellipse cx=\"300\" cy=\"400\" rx=\"100\" ry=\"200\"/></svg><div class=\"container why-grid\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">Small is a good thing</p><h2 id=\"why-title\">For the gyms<br>with a little<br><em>more soul.</em></h2><p class=\"why-intro\">The ones where the owner sets routes, the staff know your name, and everyone cheers for your first send.</p></div><div class=\"principles\"><div class=\"principle\"><span class=\"principle-number\">01 /</span><div><h3>Only what you actually need.</h3><p>Memberships, bookings, and day passes. The everyday essentials, without a maze of menus.</p></div></div><div class=\"principle\"><span class=\"principle-number\">02 /</span><div><h3>A front desk that feels human.</h3><p>Keep your attention on the person in front of you. Give your team a clear view of who's climbing and what's next.</p></div></div><div class=\"principle\"><span class=\"principle-number\">03 /</span><div><h3>Your gym. Your way of doing things.</h3><p>Room for your memberships, your class schedule, and the community that makes your gym yours.</p></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class=\"details\" id=\"pricing\"><div class=\"container details-grid\"><div class=\"pricing\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">A good fit, from the start</p><h2>Small gym.<br>No small print.</h2><p>One home for your gym's everyday essentials. Explore the demo and see what a calmer front desk could look like.</p><ul class=\"pricing-list\"><li><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg>Memberships and recurring renewals</li><li><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg>Class scheduling and bookings</li><li><svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg>Day passes and quick check-ins</li></ul><button class=\"button button-outline\" id=\"plan-button\">Find the right fit <svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-arrow\"/></svg></button></div><div class=\"faq\" id=\"faq\"><h2>A few things you might be wondering.</h2><details><summary>Is Tidepool right for a small climbing gym?<svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-plus\"/></svg></summary><p>That's who it's designed for: independent gyms that need a straightforward way to manage members, classes, and day passes. You can try those everyday tasks in the interactive demo.</p></details><details><summary>Can I try it before making a decision?<svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-plus\"/></svg></summary><p>Absolutely. Choose “Meet Tidepool” to explore a sample workspace. Check a member in, book a class spot, or create a sample day pass. No account or payment details needed.</p></details><details><summary>What does Tidepool cost?<svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-plus\"/></svg></summary><p>Paid plans aren't available on this preview page yet. The interactive demo is free to explore, with no payment details needed.</p></details><details><summary>Can I bring my existing members over?<svg class=\"icon\"><use href=\"#i-plus\"/></svg></summary><p>This preview lets you explore the member experience using sample data. Member imports and account setup aren't available here, so keep your current records in place while you take a look.</p></details></div></div></section>
